!CHECK 217562.00 | 000004.11 04 | line 32 KVI,4,4.0 -TEST IF TAPE -- the .11 carries index 4 in bits 19-22
!CHECK 217562.40 | 217567.72 C0 | line 33 BZXE,K YOME -BR. IF CONSOLE -- forward reference to line 43; the C0 is produced, not read off ink
!CHECK 217563.00 | 000007.52 3C | line 34 LV,5,S FILE K($12) -IF TAPE, TEST IF FILE K IS ZERO
!CHECK 217563.40 | 217565.31 40 | line 35 BZXVZ,K TEST M -- same target as line 16, different operation bits
